# Unrestricted triplet O2: the two pi_g electrons in m=+1 and m=-1 of
# the same spin form the 3Sigma_g- ground state.
System O2.xyz
Basis cc-pVDZ
Method hyb_gga_xc_b3lyp
Multiplicity 3
Restricted false
ComplexBasis true
JKMethod Cholesky
DFTGrid 75 -302
ConvThr 1e-7
SaveChk complex_orbs_o2_b3lyp_triplet.chk
